Student Records Management System
Description

This Python program allows users to manage student records. It stores student names and grades for three subjects, calculates averages, displays records, searches for students, and updates student information.

Features
Add student records
Validate grade input (0-100)
Calculate student averages
Display individual student details
Display class summary
Search for a student
Update student grades
Handle invalid numeric input
Subjects

The system records grades for:

Maths
Economics
Statistics
How the Program Works
1. Add Students

The user enters:

Student name
Maths grade
Economics grade
Statistics grade

The program stores the information in a dictionary.

2. Display Class Summary

After all students are entered, the program displays:

Student name
Individual subject grades
Average grade
3. Search for a Student

The user enters a student's name to view:

Student details
Grades
Average score
4. Update Student Records

The user can:

Search for an existing student
Enter new grades
Save the updated record
5. Display Updated Records

The updated class summary is displayed showing all changes.

