Input Validation

The program ensures:

Grades are numeric values.
Grades are between 0 and 100.
Invalid inputs are handled using try-except.
Functions
add_student()

Adds a student and their grades.

calculate_average(student_grades)

Calculates and returns the average grade.

display_student(student_name)

Displays information for a specified student.

display_summary()

Displays all student records and averages.

search_and_update()

Searches for a student and updates their grades.

